      "properties": {"text": ""},
      "widgets_values": ["=== SVI 2.0 Pro Workflow ===\n\nThis workflow implements proper SVI motion latent passing between clips.\n\nSHARED PARAMETERS (above):\n- STEPS, CFG, SHIFT: Sampling parameters (Get in each clip)\n- WIDTH, HEIGHT, NUM_FRAMES: Video dimensions\n- HIGH_MODEL, LOW_MODEL: Models with LoRAs\n- VAE, ANCHOR_IMAGE: Shared resources\n\nEACH CLIP HAS:\n- Its own PROMPT (WanVideoTextEncode)\n- Its own SEED (for variation)\n- Get nodes to pull shared parameters\n\nTO ADD MORE CLIPS:\n1. Duplicate the CLIP 2 group\n2. Connect motion_latent from previous clip\n3. Change the seed and prompt as desired"],
